                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td class="px-md py-4 text-on-surface-variant">lucia.m@carpintec.com</td>
                                <td class="px-md py-4">
                                    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container rounded-full text-xs font-label-md">Diseñador de Muebles</span>
                                </td>
                                <td class="px-md py-4 text-center">
                                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-tertiary">
                                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-tertiary"></span> Activo
                                    </span>
